    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia kūbagunanha bahabī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahayimanīla bandya kūlīla a banhū na a bake babo, kūlwa nguno ya badūgū babo a Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò balīlaga balīhaya, “A bise na a bitūnja bise na bashīke bise tūlī bingī no, tūtūdūla ū kūpīla ūlū tūtapandīkile shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī bahayaga, “Tūleega a malaale gise nī migūnda yise ya mizabibu, pyī dūhū nī numba jise, gīkī tūpandīke shilīwa, kūlwa nguno ya nzala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bangī hangī būyūhaya, “Tūlī na magasa, nguno tūkūsolaga hela ja banhū, gīkī tūpandīke ja kūtoba goodi ya ntemi, kūlwa malaale gise nī migūnda yise ya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo nūūlū īkī a badūgū bise balī mīlī na mininga gise gete, na a bitūnja bise balī gīt'ūmo balī a bitūnja babo, alīyo nahene īkūtwigeleelaga kūbatūūla mu būsese a bitūnja bise na a bashīke bise. Nīyo ī haha bashīke bise bamò balī mu būsese, alīyo tūtī nabo ū būdūla; nguno a malaale gise nī migūnda yise ya mizabibu ī haha sabo ya bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nawigwa ū būlīji wabo nū wibūūji wenūbū, nakasaaya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahayūyideedeng'hanya ī yenīyī ū mu ntwe gwane, nūbawīla a bataale na a batongeeji, “A bing'we mukūbasabīlaga a biching'wi!” Hūna nūbilinga lūbanza lūtaale lwa kwīhooyela ī mihayo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūhaya, “A bise tūkūgemaga gīt'ūmo būlī ū būdūla wise, kūbagūla a badūgū bise a Bayudaya, kūfuma ū kū banhū ba mahanga ūko bajinjiwa mu būsese. Alīyo a bing'we mulīyūbajinja a badūgū bing'we, gīkī tūjingījiwe hangī a bise!” Būhuumūla sele, nguno bakagayiwa ū gwa kūshosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nongeja kūbawīla nalīhaya, “Īyo mulīyīta yenīyī yabūbi no, ītang'wigeleelilwe kūshimīzīla mu logohano lwa ng'wa Mulungu wise, tūtizikala tūkūsondagūlagwa na a banishi bise, a banhū ba mahanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene na a badūgū bane tūkūfunyaga hela na shilīwa gīkī bayūlanda a banhū; hūna lūūlū ū mhayo gwa kūbapandīkīla solobo banhū gwenūyū gūche! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashokejagi wangū a malaale gabo, nī migūnda yabo ya mizabibu, nī ya mizeituni, pyī nī numba jabo; nī solobo īyo ng'wapandīka kūlwa kūbanyeekeja, īyī īmò ya ng'wigana ya kūfuma ū mu hela, nū mu shilīwa nū mu divai, nū mu maguta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būhaya, “Tūkūbashokeja nīyo toyaga ū kūbanyeekeja shikolo shose shose, tūkwīta gīt'ūmo ūlīhayīla.” Hūna nūbitana a bagabīji, nūbilahīja a bataale na a basugi benabo gīkī bakwīshikīlīja īyo bakisagīja kwīyīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūgung'humūla nī ng'hanjo yane; kūnū nalīhaya, “Ū Mulungu ni angung'humūlage gīkī būlī ng'wene ūyo alaleke ū kūshikīlīja ū kwisagīja kwakwe; ang'wīnje ū mu numba yakwe, nū mu milīmo yakwe. Ū munhū wa mbika yenīyo akūgung'humūlwa gīko, īngījiwe būlī shikolo.” Pyī ū lūbanza lūhaya, “Alichene mu kūnkumīlīja SEEBA. Na ng'hana a banhū bīta gīt'ūmo kwalī ū kwisagīja kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilīwa sha malīngīīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī a higūlya ya henaho, kūfuma aho nasolwa kūbiza nsugi ū mu sī ya Būyudaya, ū mu ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī gwa ntemi Atashasta, kūshisha ng'waka gwa makūmi adatū n'ībīlī, hū kūhaya myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī, ī shilīwa īsho shalī shihelilwe kūlwa kaya ya nsugi natashilile ū nene ng'wenekīlī, nūūlū a badūgū bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a basugi abo baalī batongi aho nataalī ū nene, baalī babaseseja a banhū nigo ndito no, nguno nūūlū īkī bapandīkaga ī shilīwa nī divai, alīyo a higūlya ya yenīyo, bahadīkījaga kwinhwa na shipande shitanò sha feza. Na a bagunanhi babo nabo babakoyaga no a banhū; alīyo ū nene natīītile ī yenīyo kūlwa nguno naalī nang'ogohile Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naalī nifunya gete ū kū nīmo gwa ndugu yenīyo, pye a banhū bane baalī balolelile henaho, tūtadimile sī nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a higūlya ya henaho, Bayudaya na batūmami ba selekali ba kūshika igana na makūmi atanò, baalīīlaga a ha meza yane; kūleka kūbisaaba abo bizaga kūtūlola kūfuma kū mahanga ayo gaalī gatūpīndije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū yasīnzagwa nzīkū ya ng'ombe, na ng'holo ng'īnu itanò, na magoko ayo nabeegejiagwa ū nene. Hama būlī shikū ikūmi yenhagwa divai ningī ya būlī mbika. Ī chene napandīkaga shenīshi dūhū, alīyo nahene hū natahadīkile gīkī nayūpandīka ī shilīwa īsho shalī shing'wigeleelilwe nsugi; nguno a banhū benaba balī na nigo ndito no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wane, nizūkagwe kūnīītīla yawiza kūlwa yose īyo nabīītīla a banhū benaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
